      "message": "Give a person's head the mockup's shape, and a window to count in\n\nThe mockup put an 88px mark level with a 28px name, the facts as\nlabels over values, and no chip saying \"Person\": the face says it. The\npage had a 48px mark centred on the whole block, a smaller name, and\nthe chip. Now the head is the mockup's, and it sits above the columns\nwith the tabs, so the rail starts under them rather than beside the\nname. Links leave the head for Reach in the rail, each named by what it\npoints at; the organisations there say how many repositories the\nreader may see.\n\nStanding and Judgement count the last ninety days unless the reader\nasks for everything since the person arrived; the toggle sits where\nthe caption was, and the tabs keep the choice. The figures, the section\nheadings and the tab counts take the sizes the mockup set.\n\nChange-Id: Ihead0167\nTask: t-1qwx5byrk2wdj5zwc7f7bc3rb6\nSigned-off-by: Mandip Adhikari <92096340+mandipadk@users.noreply.github.com>",
